{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:aa2bdd58efdd5fff","name":"Smuggling Talent Tree","source":{"id":"source:reference-aa2bdd58efdd5fff","title":"Smuggling Talent Tree","revision":19576,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T22:13:16Z","sha256":"32ec2ae15be335744eed27990ddd2e832326721a13c5c7c2e1c19019a788bedc","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=19576","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Smuggling%20Talent%20Tree&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-aa2bdd58efdd5fff","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Unleashed Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Unleashed_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Smuggling is part skill, part talent, and part luck. The most notorious smugglers in the galaxy get along by making use of their quick wits and savvy.\n"]},"\n\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Core Talents"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Art of Concealment"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Some smugglers are adept at hiding contraband and weapons, even on their person. When making a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stealth"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stealth","referenceId":"reference:526a40a447ddd7aa"}," check to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Conceal"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Conceal"}," an item, you can ",{"tag":"a","children":["Take 10"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Take_10"}," even under pressure. Additionally, you can ",{"tag":"a","children":["Conceal"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Conceal"}," an item as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Fast Talker"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Art of Concealment"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Smugglers must be quick to explain discrepancies in their cover stories. Once per day, you can ",{"tag":"a","children":["Take 20"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Take_20"}," on a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Deception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Deception","referenceId":"reference:17455029fb9994a3"}," check as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"}," when attempting to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Deceive"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Deceive"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Hidden Weapons"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Art of Concealment"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["If you draw a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Concealed Weapon"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Concealed_Weapon"}," and, before the end of the same round, make an attack against a target that failed to notice the item, the target is considered ",{"tag":"a","children":["Flat-Footed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Flat-Footed"}," against you. You can draw a concealed item or a stowed item as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Move Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Move_Action"},". Additionally, if you have the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Quick Draw"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Quick_Draw","referenceId":"reference:ad3a4bd9344ce557"}," feat, you can reduce this to a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Illicit Dealings"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Smugglers have a knack for locating and negotiating illicit deals. When using ",{"tag":"a","children":["Persuasion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Persuasion","referenceId":"reference:196fbdc5f1823320"}," to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Haggle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Haggle"}," for ",{"tag":"a","children":["Restricted"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Restricted"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Military"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Military"},", or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Illegal"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Illegal"}," goods you may roll twice, keeping the better of the two results.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Surprise Strike"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Sometimes a smuggler has to fight his way out of a bad situation. If you fail any ",{"tag":"a","children":["Deception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Deception","referenceId":"reference:17455029fb9994a3"}," check to convey ",{"tag":"a","children":["Deceptive Information"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Deceptive_Information"},", you can initiate combat and make a single ",{"tag":"a","children":["Unarmed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Unarmed"}," attack as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Free Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Free_Action"}," in the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Surprise Round"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Surprise_Round"}," (or with a melee or ranged weapon, if you have the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Quick Draw"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Quick_Draw","referenceId":"reference:ad3a4bd9344ce557"}," feat); all other combatants are considered ",{"tag":"a","children":["Surprised"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Surprised"}," even if they are aware of you.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
